		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4853&amp;p=35652#p35652"><![CDATA[
<ul><li> In DMR mode, clear the LC data after an APRS beaconing to avoid handling incomplete data (wrong IDs and so on).</li><li> Fix APRS QSY: RX and TX freqs were swapped.</li></ul>The firmwares are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/BH7YMM2DFG#uuennWe2fZGi" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/BH7YMM2DFG#uuennWe2fZGi</a><br>The voice prompts are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/H0XNJZFH08#YPSZxRlhHBGG" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/H0XNJZFH08#YPSZxRlhHBGG</a><br><br><strong class="text-strong">NOTE</strong>: You <span style="text-decoration:underline">need</span> to use a CPS version greater or equal the the 2025/01/26. See the CPS section <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?f=12&amp;t=4804" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?f=12&amp;t=4804</a><br><br>For translators, the on-screen texts, voice prompts CSV and CPS XML files are located at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/256SP2W1NM#mC9d2L32MEmb" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/256SP2W1NM#mC9d2L32MEmb</a><br>The voice-prompts and localization files have not changed since the last beta.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Fri Feb 07, 2025 4:04 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
